      "settings": {
        "kicker": "Nordic botanical heritage",
        "heading": "The Bergfrue Story",
        "text": "<p>The Bergfrue flower grows where few things can — quiet, rugged places shaped by wind and snow. It became our first symbol: resilience, softness, and beauty carried through hard seasons.</p><p>Like the flower, our jewellery is designed to feel gentle but enduring. Each bangle and charm carries a memory, a moment, or a meaning — never just decoration.</p>",
        "button_label": "Explore the collection",
        "button_link": "shopify://collections/all",
        "quote": "Beauty should feel quiet, personal, and true.",
        "quote_author": "BLÓMINOR NORWAY",
        "parchment_background": true,
        "padding": 80
      }
    },
